      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i guess i just want to stay motivated too. sometimes when i'm doing stuff that is hard or frustrating, i feel like my brain just wants to quit or distract me with random, annoying thoughts. do you have any advice for staying mentally focused when the workout gets really uncomfortable or when my mind starts wandering?",
